Participation Schedule for Two Explicit Participant Reports
For settlement with First Participant:
  First Amount is USD 12.
  Report "first": Participant, First Amount.
For settlement with Second Participant:
  Second Amount is USD 7.
  Report "second": Participant, Second Amount.

Bindings:
  Schedule TwoParticipants.
  Using language "spl/0.1-draft" core "spl-core/0.1-draft" schema "spl-data/0.1-draft".
  input first_party: Id<Participant>;
  input second_party: Id<Participant>;
  Settle "First Participant" with first_party.
  Settle "Second Participant" with second_party.
  Bind "Participant" to settlement_participant.
  Bind "First Amount" to first_amount.
  Bind "Second Amount" to second_amount.
  Field "Participant" as participant_id.
  Field "First Amount" as amount.
  Field "Second Amount" as amount.
